## Original Content
O ministro dos Negócios Estrangeiros diz que só a AD, com a sua moderação pode governar o País, já que o PS é sinónimo de "laxismo" e "deixa-andar-a-ver-se dá" e Chega de "demagogia e mentira".

## Summary
The Minister of Foreign Affairs criticizes political figures Carneiro and Ventura, deeming them incapable of leading the country. He asserts that only the AD party, with its moderate approach, is suitable for governing, while condemning the PS and Chega parties for their perceived flaws of laxism and demagoguery.

## Key Points
- The Minister of Foreign Affairs endorses the AD party for its moderation as the only viable option for governing.
- He criticizes the PS party for being synonymous with laxism and ineffective governance.
- He accuses the Chega party of engaging in demagoguery and spreading lies.
- The article highlights political opinions and endorsements in a competitive landscape.


